              "content": "A page of a collection of block headers in **ascending** order\nthat satisfies query parameters. Any block header from the chain\ndatabase is returned. **This includes headers of orphaned blocks.**\n",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
            "url": {
              "path": [
                "chain",
                ":chain",
                "header"
